        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: செய்திக்குறிப்பு",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "செய்திக்குறிப்பு — ceytikkuṟippu — \"a press release\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "காவல்துறை ஒரு செய்திக்குறிப்பை வெளியிட்டது. kāvaltuṟai oru ceytikkuṟippai veḷiyiṭṭatu. The police issued a press release."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "செய்தி, news + குறிப்பு, a note."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "செய்திக்குறிப்பு (ceytikkuṟippu) is a Tamil compound built from செய்தி, \"news\" (DEDR 1957), and குறிப்பு, \"a note\", from குறி, \"to aim, mark\" (DEDR 1847)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
