          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பத்திரிகை (pattirikai) is borrowed from Sanskrit pattrikā, \"a leaf, a letter\", from pattra, \"leaf, leaf of a book\" (CDIAL 7733)."
